// The environment (M6 Task 10).
//
// `getenv(name)` is a builtin, not a function in this module: the name lives in
// the one shared scope, so a wrapper would be a duplicate definition. It answers
// the variable's value as a fresh owned string, or the empty string when the
// variable is unset. An unset variable and an empty one therefore read the same;
// the language has no `Option` in a builtin's signature yet.
//
// Ownership: the argument is borrowed and the result is owned.
